@startuml F2.1-D04-bloqueio-rota-aluno
title F2.1-D04 — Bloqueio de rota de aluno
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Egresso" as Egresso
participant "WebApp" as WebApp

Egresso -> WebApp: tenta /solicitacoes/nova

